    "The 3D globe is Apple Maps and loads map imagery from Apple while it is open. The flat map loads nothing." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der 3D-Globus ist Apple Karten und lädt, solange er offen ist, Kartenmaterial von Apple. Die flache Karte lädt nichts."
          }
